## The release's VM flags, read by release/start.
##
## The server runs as one node and uses no Erlang distribution: this file sets
## no -name and no -sname, and ./setup-check refuses one that does.

## No Erlang shell: the server is started by a host, not by a person.
-noshell

## Log at info, so the log tells when the server runs and when it stops.
-kernel logger_level info
